WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.834
-Thank you very much.

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:02.835
Welcome, welcome, welcome

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.738
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:06.773
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:09.542
Well, guys, it was just
another crazy week

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.577
and tonight President Trump
did his first

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:14.147
on-camera interview
since he got COVID.

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.982
Let's see who he decided
to talk to.

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.250 line:0%
-We have just learned
this morning

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.718 line:0%
that President Trump
is set to appear

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:21.520 line:0%
in his first on-camera
interview tonight

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.223 line:0%
and will apparently get
a medical evaluation,

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:25.692 line:0%
not by the White House
physician,

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.294 line:0%
but by a doctor on Fox News,

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.496 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
according to the cable network.

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:32.198
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:35.902
-That's right, Trump got
a remote medical evaluation.

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:38.505
It's like a Zoom physical.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:40.640
It was a tough choice
for TV viewers --

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.209
Yankee playoff game,
NBA finals,

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.411
or hearing about
a 74-year-old man's body.

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:47.546
[ Laughter ].

00:00:47.546 --> 00:00:49.148
"Can we catch all three?"

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:50.282
No, you can't.

00:00:50.282 --> 00:00:51.717
A medical exam on TV?

00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:53.353
I feel like Trump's
one step away

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:55.522
from taking a COVID test
on "Maury."

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:57.023
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:58.891
"You do not have the virus!"

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:00.059
[ Laughter ]
Aah!

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:03.530
♪♪

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.930
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:07.100
I'm sure the guy who evaluated
Trump is qualified.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.035
I mean, to be a Fox News doctor,

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.870
you have to go
to medical school in Queens

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:11.905
for a whole three hours.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.739
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.739 --> 00:01:15.307
It was really
bizarre television,

00:01:15.307 --> 00:01:17.109
especially when Trump
told the doctor --

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:18.845
[ As Trump ]
Might as well check
my prostate while I'm here.

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:21.014
[ Laughter ]
I mean, just --
-Oof.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:22.015
At least, Trump seemed like

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:23.816
he was in a playful mood
during the exam.

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.618
When the doctor said
he would need a sample

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:27.720
of his blood, urine, and stool,

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.121
Trump gave him his underwear.

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:30.656
[ Audience oohs ]
-Ew!

00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:32.424
- [ As Trump ]
Come on, it's a classic!

00:01:32.424 --> 00:01:34.360
It's a classic!

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:39.265
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:41.901
I've never really seen him
laugh, Trump, right?

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.903
What does he laugh like?

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:44.971
Like --
[ Silent ]

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.606
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.741
Like a silent laugh?
-A Muppet, yeah.

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.944
-Yeah, he's like a Muppet,
like --

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.678
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.678 --> 00:01:54.213
-Maybe like a robot, like

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:58.117
"Ah-ah-ah-ah-ah-ah."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.117 --> 00:01:59.351
-Or maybe he's like, you know,

00:01:59.351 --> 00:02:02.188
some people laugh
like Ernie, too. Like --

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.789
[ Snickering ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:05.825
-Oh, yeah.
Yeah, that's a good one, yeah.

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:07.560
-[ Snickering ]
Yeah, that's a good one.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.928
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:10.463
Actually, I was impressed
with the doctor.

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.999
He remembered every single word
Trump told him to say.

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:14.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:17.704
That's right, Trump was given
a virtual medical exam on TV.

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:19.806
I guess that explains
this promo I saw.

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.441
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:26.812 line:0%
That's why you should watch...

00:02:26.812 --> 00:02:31.150 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.718
-Yeah, the last few days,

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:34.253
Trump has been all
over Fox News.

00:02:34.253 --> 00:02:36.622
Last night, he called in
to Sean Hannity.

00:02:36.622 --> 00:02:39.025
At this point, even regular
Fox News viewers are like,

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:40.326
"Ugh.
This guy, again?"

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.594
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.396
By now, anytime
Trump calls Fox News,

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:45.098
it comes up as potential spam.

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:47.867
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:50.569
During the interview,
Trump didn't sound too good.

00:02:50.569 --> 00:02:51.671
Take a listen to this.

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:55.174 line:0%
[ Clears throat ]

00:02:55.174 --> 00:02:57.409 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:02:57.409 --> 00:02:58.511 line:0%
-Yeah --

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:03.616 line:0%
[ Clears throats ]

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:06.186 line:0%
[ Clears throat ]

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:10.923
-Wow!
-[ Murmuring ]

00:03:10.923 --> 00:03:12.759
-That's great. The president
of the United States

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:14.827
is slowly turning
into the Mucinex monster.

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:16.829
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:18.197
A second later,
Trump was like --

00:03:18.197 --> 00:03:19.231
[ As Trump ]
[ Coughing ]

00:03:19.231 --> 00:03:20.767
Sorry, hair ball.

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:22.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:25.037
Hannity then tried asking Trump
if he'd been tested for COVID

00:03:25.037 --> 00:03:26.905
and Trump wouldn't
give a clear answer.

00:03:26.905 --> 00:03:27.973 line:0%
Listen to this.
-Have you been

00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:30.343 line:0%
tested recently?
-Or sooner, maybe.

00:03:35.581 --> 00:03:36.849 line:0%
I know I'm whether
I'm great shape or not.
-Did you test negative?

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:40.653
[ Laughter ]
-Have you had a test

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:43.890
since your diagnosis a week ago?

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:48.595 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:54.500
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.636
-So...the answer is no.

00:03:56.636 --> 00:03:58.871
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:02.342
His doctor will only examine him
on TV from 200 miles away.

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:04.343
I think it's safe to say
that he's still positive.

00:04:04.343 --> 00:04:05.677
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.677 --> 00:04:07.480
It's like being asked,
"How'd your history test go?"

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:08.948
And you go, "Yes."

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:11.751
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:13.452
Later in the interview,
Hannity asked Trump

00:04:13.452 --> 00:04:16.322
what he thought would happen
under Biden's environmental plan

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:18.157
and he had a pretty
interesting response.

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.331 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.267 --> 00:04:32.171
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:34.172
-"Rebuild them with tiny,
little windows

00:04:34.172 --> 00:04:35.508
so you cannot see light."

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:36.575
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.575 --> 00:04:37.743
Is he attacking the Democrats

00:04:37.743 --> 00:04:39.145
or writing a haiku?

00:04:39.145 --> 00:04:41.046
[ Laughter ]
I'm worried about Trump.

00:04:41.046 --> 00:04:42.048
But later, he was like --

00:04:42.048 --> 00:04:43.982
[ As Trump ]
To the window,

00:04:43.982 --> 00:04:45.952
[ Laughter ]
to the wall,

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:48.220
'till the sweat drop down my

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:52.792
[ Coughing ]
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:53.793
Hair balls.

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.894
[ Laughter ]

00:04:55.894 --> 00:04:56.896
It didn't stop there.

00:04:56.896 --> 00:04:58.631
Trump then talked
about California's

00:04:58.631 --> 00:05:00.667
water situation.
Listen to this.

00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:14.713 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.713 --> 00:05:16.816 line:0%
[ Laughter intensifies ]
-No! No!

00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:18.684 line:0%
[ Applause ]
No!

00:05:18.684 --> 00:05:21.220
[ Laughter ]
No. No, man.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:23.089
-I swear, it's real.
-Y'all did that.

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:25.391
-No, it's real.
No, that is his exact --

00:05:25.391 --> 00:05:27.526
-This is the new "Do Not Read."
Y'all did that.

00:05:27.526 --> 00:05:29.529
-I swear.
-There's no way!

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:32.264
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.264 --> 00:05:34.367
-Tiny windows, tiny fish.

00:05:34.367 --> 00:05:36.502
He sounds like
those YouTube videos of kids

00:05:36.502 --> 00:05:37.870
after they get
their wisdom teeth out.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.006
[ Laughter ]

00:05:40.006 --> 00:05:42.542
Then, today, Trump called in
to Rush Limbaugh's radio show

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:44.843
for two hours.
-Agh!

00:05:44.843 --> 00:05:46.879
-And, at one point,
he dropped an F-bomb

00:05:46.879 --> 00:05:48.948
while talking about Iran.
Listen to this.

00:05:48.948 --> 00:05:50.916 line:0%
-And Iran knows that and they've
been put on notice --

00:05:50.916 --> 00:05:54.153 line:0%
if you [bleep] around with us,
if you do something bad to us,

00:05:54.153 --> 00:05:56.688 line:0%
we are going to do things to you

00:05:56.688 --> 00:05:58.591 line:0%
that have never
been done before.

00:05:58.591 --> 00:05:59.725
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.725 --> 00:06:02.061
-Yeah. When Mike Pence
heard Trump curse,

00:06:02.061 --> 00:06:03.963
he took two flies
and stuck them in his ears.

00:06:03.963 --> 00:06:07.900
[ Laughter ]

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.102
[ As Pence ]
Not today, Satan!

00:06:10.102 --> 00:06:12.839
[ Laughter ]

00:06:12.839 --> 00:06:14.373
Well, Trump says he's
feeling better

00:06:14.373 --> 00:06:15.841
and doctors are crediting
his recovery

00:06:15.841 --> 00:06:18.677
to some advanced treatments,
including a steroid.

00:06:18.677 --> 00:06:20.713
But I don't know if it's
the best choice for Trump.

00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:22.381
Take a look at this ad
I saw the other night.

00:06:22.381 --> 00:06:25.084
-Reclaim the day with...

00:06:25.084 --> 00:06:26.552
Dexamethasone
has been used to treat

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:28.787
moderate to severe cases
of COVID-19.

00:06:28.787 --> 00:06:31.190
While effective, dexamethasone
isn't for everyone.

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:33.092
You shouldn't take
dexamethasone if you...

00:06:34.193 --> 00:06:35.595
[ Laughter ]

00:06:38.998 --> 00:06:40.500
Side effects may include...

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.471
[ Laughter ]

00:06:53.412 --> 00:06:58.384
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:58.384 --> 00:06:59.685
-Hey, this is going viral --

00:06:59.685 --> 00:07:02.522
a woman shared a picture
of a frozen tuna steak

00:07:02.522 --> 00:07:04.290
that looks like President Trump.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:06.058
Take a look at this.
See if you can see the --

00:07:06.058 --> 00:07:08.961
[ Audience oohs ]
[ Laughter ]

00:07:08.961 --> 00:07:10.295
Trump saw that and was like --

00:07:10.295 --> 00:07:11.731
[ As Trump ]
Now, that's the tan
I'm looking for.

00:07:11.731 --> 00:07:13.499
[ Laughter ]

00:07:13.499 --> 00:07:14.934
Oh, I saw that
a pet owner wanted

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:16.936
to keep her dogs in the yard,

00:07:16.936 --> 00:07:19.371
but she also wanted them
to see her come home,

00:07:19.371 --> 00:07:21.307
so she came up
with this solution.

00:07:25.478 --> 00:07:28.814
[ Laughter ]

00:07:28.814 --> 00:07:29.982
-Hi!

00:07:29.982 --> 00:07:31.751
[ Laughter ]
Hi.

00:07:31.751 --> 00:07:33.953
-[ Whining ]

00:07:33.953 --> 00:07:36.221
[ Laughter ]

00:07:36.221 --> 00:07:37.690
-That's what happens
when you're trapped

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.825
in your house
for seven months.

00:07:39.825 --> 00:07:41.894
"I'm gonna go make some
dog holes in the fence."

00:07:41.894 --> 00:07:44.163
[ Laughter ]

00:07:44.163 --> 00:07:46.332
Honey, any headway
with the job search?

00:07:46.332 --> 00:07:50.369
"No, but I made a couple of --
couple dog holes in the --"

00:07:50.369 --> 00:07:52.438
[ Laughter ]

00:07:52.438 --> 00:07:54.006
And, finally, these days,
it can feel like

00:07:54.006 --> 00:07:55.441
there's a lot going wrong
with the world

00:07:55.441 --> 00:07:57.576
and sometimes you just wish
you could make it right.

00:07:57.576 --> 00:07:59.778
Well, luckily, we're able to do
that here at "The Tonight Show."

00:07:59.778 --> 00:08:01.948
It's time
for "This Week Made Right."

00:08:01.948 --> 00:08:03.382
Check it out.
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:08:03.382 --> 00:08:08.120
♪♪

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:11.690 line:0%
-Shockingly, President Trump
has left Walter Reed hospital

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:13.292 line:0%
to ride around in his SU--

00:08:13.292 --> 00:08:14.293 line:0%
Oh, wait a second.

00:08:14.293 --> 00:08:15.328 line:0%
-Aaaaah!

00:08:15.328 --> 00:08:16.695 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:16.695 --> 00:08:18.164 line:0%
Okay, yep, that's probably

00:08:18.164 --> 00:08:20.199 line:0%
for the best.
-Get in there!
-Aaah!

00:08:20.199 --> 00:08:22.968 line:15%
-That's right, after a heated
presidential debate last week,

00:08:22.968 --> 00:08:25.871 line:15%
the VP candidates have agreed
to sit in silence

00:08:25.871 --> 00:08:27.173 line:14%
and smile at one another.

00:08:27.173 --> 00:08:29.175 line:14%
Let's take a look.

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:31.777 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:31.777 --> 00:08:35.948 line:0%
♪♪

00:08:35.948 --> 00:08:37.950 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.752 line:0%
-Shocker for the Patriots
this week.

00:08:39.752 --> 00:08:41.654 line:0%
Cam Newton is out with COVID.

00:08:41.654 --> 00:08:43.289 line:0%
He could be done for the season.

00:08:43.289 --> 00:08:44.790 line:0%
-Oh, wait a second, Al.
Not so fast.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.459 line:0%
-Well, look at that.
It's Cam Newton.

00:08:47.459 --> 00:08:48.560 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:49.828
-Is a great insult...

00:08:49.828 --> 00:08:51.563
[ Fly buzzing ]

00:08:51.563 --> 00:08:53.732
...to the men and women
who serve in law enforcement

00:08:53.732 --> 00:08:56.402 line:88%
and I want everyone to know,
who puts on the uniform.
[ Laughter ]

